\textit{Whisper-large-v3} is an upgraded version of \textit{Whisper-large-v2}, trained on 1 million hours of high-quality speech-text pairs and an additional 4 million hours of pseudo-labeled audio. Using a 4.4\% Mandarin composition in the \textit{Whisper-v1} training data as a reference, we estimate that \textit{Whisper-large-v3} was exposed to approximately 220,000 hours of Mandarin data throughout training. 
