\subsubsection{Performance: Power and Time}
Notice that even though energy consumption and running time plots seem to be exactly the same, power doesn't vary nearly as much as time results do. When calculating energy the difference in power usage is much less noticeable compared to huge variations in time, taking the data from the  Expanse 32 block size experiment as an example. 

