    \item \textbf{Differential Diagnosis:} Gemini-2.0-Flash demonstrated superior micro-averaged diagnostic accuracy (78\%).
\end{itemize}

Based on these evaluations, we constructed the \textit{Best of Breed} system using GPT-4o for information gathering, GPT-4.1 for information interpretation, and Gemini-2.0-Flash for differential diagnosis.

