		\includegraphics[scale=0.67]{drawings/CgadgetNAE}
		\caption{Gadgets for the clauses $C_1=(a\lor b \lor c)$ and $C_2=(d\lor e \lor a)$.
			Waiting is only allowed at vertices 1, 2 and 3.
			The consistence of the common variable $a$ in both clauses is accomplished by adding an edge labeled with
