\noindent Within the Q-region QR of the example X (subconstituent QR within constituent X), the substrings of the template (\ref{ex:SWtempl}) --- \sf{Q}, \textit{x}, \sf{V}, \textit{y} --- are treated as four subconstituents we will call \textit{fields}: they are labelled FQ, F1, FV, F2.
