This is not suitable for a vectorized accelerator like EFFACT which can only access SRAM row by row.
On the other side, the transpose units proposed by CraterLake\cite{samardzic_craterlake_2022} demand excessive global connections, causing a large area.
Therefore, EFFACT proposes a modified algorithm replacing the expensive matrix transpose operation with a fixed network (FN). 
