as well as inter-modality context from $V$ will contribute. Here, the temporal synchronized visual cue of $X_{mask}$ serves as a direct visual cue, and the remaining visual frames serve as visual contextual cues. To distinguish different levels of contribution, the relevance of the context is represented by curves of varying thickness. 
